<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 224-7 AT CLOSE IN THIRD TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 224-7 AT CLOSE IN THIRD TEST.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 224-7 at the close of play on the first day of the third cricket test at Old Trafford on Thursday.</p>
